From c5c03a2b7b918fe6550f9039d0f4f93c1b191964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 6 Jul 2022 18:12:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0538/1695] pta: stm32mp: add new remoteproc PTA

Add remoteproc PTA for the stm32mp1 platform.
The PTA relies on the stm32_remoteproc driver for the remoteproc
management.
It is charge of providing interface for authenticating firmware images
and managing the remote processor live cycle.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 5c0232068acab65024d11f595b881c357bd8e0b6 pta: stm32mp: add new remoteproc PTA]
